;    0: TWdCondition(count=1458, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1343, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Something bad has happened. This will wreck the plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was some kind of commotion on the first floor, so I had been listening in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\桜の枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Apparently Shirozaki-san had come to deliver a branch with cherry blossoms on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> would carry it at tomorrow's thirteenth-year memorial service.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, what a thing to do...! Why does everyone have so little imagination?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't they understand what the residents will think if they do that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It will have completely the opposite effect...!<PG>
The witch's power―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is the danger sense that appears only in this season.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is triggered when a human who has become a second generation of Droga is in a place with cherry pollen and, on top of that, is doused in first-generation blood again.<PG>
Why it came to be called the witch's power, I do not know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At some point, one of the residents started calling it that.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Most likely, rumors spread of something like the dead <STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE> curse, and people began calling the ability that <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> had a kind of cursed power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never mind that they leaned on that power plenty when <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> was alive.<PG>
Well, none of that matters right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, I have to hurry.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\桜の枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> goes to the service carrying the cherry branch, someone wary of the witch's power might attack her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, I still have not told anyone about <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan's</STYLE> ability.<PG>
But with suspicion feeding on itself this far, I have to allow for even a worst case like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cannot let <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE> is a precious living second generation.<PG>
Then I had better use this situation and move first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will deliberately use the residents as a feint and create a situation where I can capture <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> without fail.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, before <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> goes back to Motoki-cho, I have to catch her alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> and I, never again...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
About the only thing I can do is use the residents as a feint and take <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How to capture <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> had been the biggest problem from the start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first I had meant to abduct <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> sometime after the thirteenth-year memorial service was over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But she had built a better relationship with <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE> than I had thought she would.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With those two guarding her, I cannot lay a hand on her so easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I tried to set some of the residents on her, one wrong move and I would be suspected as the curse-killing culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, it is more convenient in every way to turn all the residents against <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and have them all catch her together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Done the right way, I should be able to steer their minds into believing <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> is the curse-killing culprit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\ノートパソコン夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once everyone was asleep, I made the circular notice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The gist: 'Whoever carries a cherry branch is the witch. Everyone is to take her alive.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will send it around before the thirteenth-year memorial service, and after the service, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> will be taken alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First I will leave it at Shirozaki-san's house next door and have it passed along in turn.<PG>
This is how things stand now. Even information they would normally doubt, everyone will believe without a second thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it is less that they will believe it without a second thought than that their own standing will be at risk if they do not go through with it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They must know what will be done to them if they do not join this attack.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\アイテム\回覧板.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Good. This should take care of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> is taken alive, I take her underground, let her meet <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, and have Sakura talk her into becoming a divine messenger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking someone from Motoki-cho hostage, or the like, should make it easy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then all it takes is using some resident or other as a living first generation, and everything is finished.<PG>
With this, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> and I, forever...
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------